<title>UK: Taylor Woodrow yr profits up 45 percent.</title>
<headline>Taylor Woodrow yr profits up 45 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.0		   vs 7.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.75		   vs 2.25</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.75		   vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     66.8		   vs 46.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.19 billion	 vs 1.15 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 63.0 and 66.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Taylor Woodrow Plc.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717.</p>
